    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Active products whose blng__BillingRule__c, blng__RevenueRecognitionRule__c, or blng__TaxRule__c reference is inactive.
Why it matters: Active products pointing to inactive rules silently fall through to defaults. Revenue, billing, and tax all mis-route. Customers see surprises across multiple bills.
Suppress a finding: during a planned rule cutover.
Disable the detector: only in orgs without Salesforce Billing. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
